==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cooldown Equality}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Gardeneel Bros.]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Mini White Cyclone]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Unlike the other stages in this Colosseum, this is an endurance-based battle with The Face nuking your units and Master A. killing anything left up. To make matters worse, Coffin Zoge forces you to time Zombie Killers, while Gardeneels Warp your tanker units, leaving the Master A. and Face duo to push slowly towards your base.

===Recommended Units===
*Zombie Killers: Only one will be needed, but one nonetheless. [[Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Cat Chief]] can kill the Coffin Zoges quickly.
*[[Jelly Dumpling Cat]]: Dumpling's level 7 wave allows its Wave to hit Gardeneel and completely remove the hard part of the stage. You'll need a second Dumpling wave or a few Attack Combos if you want this to work on 2 Star, though.
*Warp Immune Tankers: High-health tanker units that can't be warped by Gardeneel are vital to this stage. Examples include [[Cat Egg Pod]], [[Green Shell Cat]], and [[Reborn Warrior Doguemon]].
*[[Awakened Doron]]: Disposable damage with a strong Surge that can either kill the Gardeneels or prevent Haniwanwan from doing anything.
*[[Fishman Cat]]: When you hit the base, the stage spawns Mini White Cyclones, which is the stage's way to prevent you from abusing Gardeneels to cheese the stage. If you end up not using Fishman, you could die to the Mini White Cyclones.

===Recommended Ubers===
*Warp Immune Nukers/Tankers: Examples include [[Valiant D'arktanyan]], [[Trixi the Merc (Uber Rare Cat)|Trixi the Revenant]], [[Almighty Hades]], [[Hell Warden Emma (Uber Rare Cat)|Hell Comissioner Emma]], and [[Lasvoss Reborn]].

